{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Implement 10 SOS (Strixhaven-themed) Magic: The Gathering card implementations in `/workspace/cards/sos/`, specifically collector numbers: **1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257**. Each card directory contains:\n   - `card_spec.json` (card metadata: name, mana_cost, oracle_text, P/T, keywords, etc.)\n   - `card_impl.py` (a stub template to fill in with the implementation class)\n   \n   The user explicitly stated:\n   - Use completed FDN cards in `/workspace/cards/fdn/` as implementation examples.\n   - Refer to `RULEBOOK.txt` for full deep-reference rules (grep, don't read whole — it's 961KB).\n   - Read engine source modules directly for API discovery (rich docstrings): `engine/card.py`, `engine/events.py`, `engine/triggers.py`, `engine/replacement_effects.py`, `engine/zones.py`.\n   - \"You are expected to make changes to the engine to implement new keywords and mechanics. The existing code base may not be perfect, you are free to make changes that don't break current behavior.\"\n   \n   **CRITICAL CONSTRAINTS (verbatim/near-verbatim, must persist):**\n   - \"Do not modify any files under workspace/engine_tests/. These tests are staged for your local verification only; the runner uses its own authoritative copies for grading. Modifying the workspace tests will not change your score — it will only mislead you about whether your engine changes are correct.\"\n   - From AGENTS.md Hard Rules: (1) Each card's implementation class must remain in `cards/sos/{card_id}/card_impl.py`; do not move/rename card directories. (2) Treat `engine_tests/` as read-only; do NOT modify/add/delete files there; likewise do NOT modify/delete existing FDN reference tests at `cards/fdn/fdn_*/tests.py` (may read, never edit); my own SOS tests belong at `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py`. (3) Additive-only engine modifications: MAY add new methods/classes/helpers/files inside `engine/` and MAY modify bodies of existing functions, but MUST NOT rename, move, or delete anything that already exists in `engine/` (no refactoring — it will break the grader's imports and zero the score).\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - MTG game engine (Python) with zones, stack, triggers, replacement effects, continuous effects (7-layer system), state-based actions, combat.\n   - Card class hierarchy: `GameObject` → `CardImpl` → `Creature`/`Instant`/`Sorcery`/`Enchantment`/`Aura`/`Artifact`/`ArtifactCreature`/`Planeswalker`/`Land`.\n   - Mechanics needed: Converge (colors of mana spent), Counterspell, Planeswalker loyalty abilities, Affinity (cost reduction), cost reduction per instant/sorcery in graveyard, attacks trigger, free-cast from graveyard/exile, Surveil, Miracle, Casualty, Paradigm, Prepared (split-card style), Reach/Flying/Vigilance/Deathtouch/Haste keywords, coin flips + skip turns, land-becomes-creature, delayed \"beginning of main phase\" triggers.\n   - `ManaCost.parse(\"{1}{U}{U}\")`, `ManaType`, `Color`, `Keyword` (enum.Flag), `Zone`, `CardType`, `Supertype`, `TargetRequirement`.\n   - DeterministicPlayer for scripted test choices; test_utils `create_game`, `set_board_state`, `cast_spell`, `advance_to_phase`, `declare_attackers`, `declare_blockers`.\n   - ContinuousEffect with Layer/SubLayer/duration (DURATION_END_OF_TURN=0, DURATION_PERMANENT=-1, or positive turn-number expiry).\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   - `/workspace/AGENTS.md` & `/workspace/PROJECT_MAP.md` — Workspace orientation and hard rules (see constraints above). FDN cards with tests.py: `fdn_13, fdn_142, fdn_205, fdn_215, fdn_244`. Workspace root is on sys.path; use bare imports like `from cards.sos.sos_1.card_impl import TheDawningArchaic`.\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/card.py` — Core class hierarchy. Key: `CardImpl` hooks: `can_cast(game)`, `cost_reduction(game)->int`, `on_cast(game)`, `on_resolve(game)`, `get_targets(game)->list`, `register_triggers(game)`, `register_replacement_effects(game)`, `get_activated_abilities()->list[ActivatedAbility]`, `get_modes()->list[Mode]`. `Creature` has base_power/base_toughness, modified_power/modified_toughness, plus_one_counters/minus_one_counters, `_reset_characteristics()`, properties `power`/`toughness`. `Planeswalker(starting_loyalty=N)` has `get_loyalty_abilities()->list[LoyaltyAbility]`, `loyalty`. `Land` has `can_cast()->False`, `get_mana_abilities()->list[ManaAbility]`, `is_tapped`. Dataclasses: `ActivatedAbility(cost, effect, description)`, `LoyaltyAbility(loyalty_cost, effect, description)`, `ManaAbility(cost, mana_produced, description)`, `Mode(name, description)`.\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/types.py` — `Keyword` flags: FLYING, FIRST_STRIKE, DOUBLE_STRIKE, DEATHTOUCH, TRAMPLE, LIFELINK, VIGILANCE, REACH, HASTE, FLASH, DEFENDER, HEXPROOF, INDESTRUCTIBLE, MENACE, WARD, PROWESS. `ManaCost(generic, pips, x_count, hybrid)` with `.cmc` and `.parse()`. `TargetRequirement(filter_fn, description, zone)`. `CardType`: CREATURE/INSTANT/SORCERY/ENCHANTMENT/ARTIFACT/PLANESWALKER/LAND.\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/casting.py` — `cast_spell()` pipeline (timing→can_cast→hand→stack→targets→protection→mana pay→on_cast→push StackObject). Sets `card.colors_spent = list(player.mana_pool.last_payment_colors)`. `cast_spell_free(game, player, card, from_zone)` casts without paying mana. `get_cost_reduction()` queries `card.cost_reduction(game)`, clamps to generic. `is_sorcery_speed()`, `can_cast_at_instant_speed()`. `_resolve_spell` sets `card.chosen_targets = stack_obj.targets` then calls on_resolve; permanents→battlefield, instants/sorceries→graveyard.\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/game.py` — Helper functions: `deal_damage`, `destroy`, `sacrifice`, `exile`, `draw_card`, `discard`, `create_token(game, player, token)` (sets is_token/owner/controller, fires ETB), `add_counter(game, permanent, \"+1/+1\", n)`, `remove_counter`, `tap`, `untap`. `draw_card` tracks `player.cards_drawn_this_turn`.\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/mana.py` — `ManaPool` with `add(mana_type, amount)`, `pay(cost, choices)`, `can_pay`, `get(mana_type)`, `last_payment_colors` property (distinct Colors spent, excludes colorless). NOTE: no \"total mana spent\" tracking exists (needed for Mana Sculpt SOS 57).\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/continuous_effects.py` — `ContinuousEffect(source, layer, sublayer, apply, timestamp, duration)`. `Layer` IntEnum (COPY=1...POWER_TOUGHNESS=7). `SubLayer` (CHARACTERISTIC_DEFINING=\"7a\", SET_PT=\"7b\", MODIFY_PT=\"7c\", COUNTERS=\"7d\"). `EffectManager.add(effect)`, `apply_all(game)` resets characteristics then applies. NOTE: card.py ALSO has an unrelated ContinuousEffect dataclass; cards use the continuous_effects.py one.\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/stack.py` — `StackObject(source, controller, targets, on_resolve, is_mana_ability)`. `Stack` with push/pop/peek/objects(). `copy_spell(game, original, controller, new_targets)` — shallow-copies source card for spell copies (needed for casualty). `game.stack._items` is the internal list (counterspells manipulate this directly).\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/triggers.py` — `TriggerRegistration(event_type, condition, effect, source, controller)`. `TriggerManager.register()`, `fire_event(game, event)`, `unregister(source)`. APNAP ordering.\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/events.py` — Triggered events: EntersBattlefield, LeavesBattlefield, DealsDamage, LosesLife, GainsLife, DrawsCard, BeginningOfUpkeep, BeginningOfCombat, EndOfTurn, EndStep, CreatureDies, **SpellCast(spell, player, card, controller)**, **Attacks(creature, attacker)**, Blocks, CounterAdded. Replacement events: MoveToGraveyard (with `destination`, `prevented`, `card` property), CreatureDies, PermanentDestroyed, Sacrifice, CreateToken, AddCounter. NOTE: No \"beginning of main phase\" event exists yet.\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/zones.py` — `move_to_zone(game, card, from_zone, to_zone, replacement_event=...)` central zone transition with trigger/replacement hooks. `move_zone(obj, from_zone, to_zone, position)`. ZoneContainer top/bottom/add/remove/shuffle.\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/turn.py` — `run_turn` iterates phases. Upkeep fires `BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent()`. Main phases fire NO event (need to add). `_do_cleanup_step` removes expired effects, clears damage. No skip-turn handling.\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/combat.py` — `declare_attackers_step` taps attackers (unless vigilance), sets `is_attacking=True`, but does NOT fire `AttacksTriggeredEvent` (need to add for SOS 1). `_can_block`, `_can_attack`, damage steps.\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/game_state.py` — GameState with `extra_turns: list[int]` FIFO (seat indices), `_normal_next_index`, `advance_phase()`. 2-player only.\n\n   - `/workspace/engine/state_based_actions.py` — Legend rule, lethal damage, zero toughness, etc.\n\n   - `/workspace/test_utils.py` — `create_game(deck1, deck2, scripts=(s1,s2))`, `set_board_state(game, idx, battlefield=, hand=, graveyard=, life=, mana=)`, `cast_spell(game, idx, name, targets=)`, `advance_to_phase`, `declare_attackers`, `declare_blockers`.\n\n   - **FDN reference card_impl.py files read (key patterns):**\n     - **fdn_167 (Tolarian Terror)** — cost reduction per instant/sorcery in graveyard (directly reusable for SOS 1):\n       ```python\n       def cost_reduction(self, game):\n           controller = self.controller\n           if controller is None: return 0\n           count = 0\n           for card in controller.zones[Zone.GRAVEYARD].get_all():\n               ct = getattr(card, \"card_types\", set())\n               if CardType.INSTANT in ct or CardType.SORCERY in ct: count += 1\n           return count\n       ```\n     - **fdn_29 (Arcane Epiphany)** — cost_reduction returns 1 if controls Wizard (subtype check in battlefield).\n     - **fdn_6 (Claws Out)** — Affinity: cost_reduction counts creatures with \"Cat\" subtype; uses ContinuousEffect for +2/+2.\n     - **fdn_48 (Refute) & fdn_160 (An Offer You Can't Refuse)** — counterspell pattern with helpers `_get_chosen_target(card, game)` and `_counter_spell(game, stack_obj)` (manipulates `game.stack._items`, removes from controller stack zone, adds to owner graveyard). `can_cast` returns True only if a valid spell is on stack; `get_targets` returns TargetRequirement with zone=Zone.STACK filtering stack objects. fdn_160 creates Treasure tokens via CardImpl with card_types={CardType.ARTIFACT}.\n     - **fdn_82 (Courageous Goblin)** — attacks trigger via `register_triggers` registering `TriggerRegistration(event_type=AttacksTriggeredEvent, condition=lambda g,e: e.creature is source and ..., effect=..., source=self, controller=...)`. Effect adds a ContinuousEffect (Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS, SubLayer.MODIFY_PT, DURATION_END_OF_TURN).\n     - **fdn_134 (Ajani planeswalker)** — `get_loyalty_abilities()` returns `[LoyaltyAbility(loyalty_cost=+1, effect=_plus1, description=...), ...]`; effects read `getattr(pw, \"_resolve_target\", None)`; minus8 uses `create_token`.\n     - **fdn_206 (Shivan Dragon)** — `get_activated_abilities()` returns ActivatedAbility with `_cost(game, src)` paying mana and `_effect` doing modified_power += 1.\n     - **fdn_133 (Soulstone Sanctuary)** — NOTE: this is still an unimplemented STUB (`class SoulstoneSanctuary(CardImpl): pass` with broken import) — NOT a usable reference for land-becomes-creature; SOS 257 will need original work.\n     - **fdn_205 (Wardens of the Cycle)** — converge: `self.colors_spent` read in on_resolve to create tokens. **fdn_244 (Progenitus)** — replacement effect registration. **fdn_215 (Bushwhack)** — modal with `chosen_mode` and `get_modes()`. **fdn_13 (Fleeting Flight)** — targeting with TargetRequirement.\n\n   - **SOS card specs (the 10 to implement):**\n     - **SOS 1 The Dawning Archaic** — Legendary 7/7 Avatar {10}; costs {1} less per instant/sorcery in graveyard; Reach; \"Whenever attacks, may cast target instant/sorcery from graveyard free; if it would go to graveyard, exile instead.\" (complex)\n     - **SOS 4 Together as One** — Sorcery {6}; Converge — Target player draws X, deal X to any target, gain X life, X=colors of mana spent. (complex)\n     - **SOS 13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares** — {1}{W}{W} 3/3 Cat Cleric // {W} Instant; ETB: target player creates 1/1 W/B Inkling flying token, then if opponent controls more creatures becomes \"prepared\"; Prepared keyword (may cast copy of its spell, unpreparing). (complex)\n     - **SOS 57 Mana Sculpt** — Instant {1}{U}{U}; Counter target spell. If you control a Wizard, add {C} equal to mana spent on that spell at beginning of your next main phase. (medium)\n     - **SOS 97 Ral Zarek, Guest Lecturer** — Legendary Planeswalker Ral {1}{B}{B} loyalty 3; +1 Surveil 2; -1 any number of target players each discard a card; -2 return creature card MV≤3 from your graveyard to battlefield; -7 flip 5 coins, target opponent skips next X turns (X=heads). (expert)\n     - **SOS 120 Improvisation Capstone** — Sorcery Lesson {5}{R}{R}; exile from top until total MV≥4, may cast any number free; Paradigm (exile this, then cast copy free at beginning of each of your first main phases). (complex)\n     - **SOS 201 Lorehold, the Historian** — Legendary 5/5 Elder Dragon {3}{R}{W}; Flying haste; each instant/sorcery card in your hand has miracle {2}; at beginning of each opponent's upkeep, may discard then draw. (expert)\n     - **SOS 226 Silverquill, the Disputant** — Legendary 4/4 Elder Dragon {2}{W}{B}; Flying vigilance; each instant/sorcery spell you cast has casualty 1 (sacrifice creature power≥1 to copy spell). (medium)\n     - **SOS 245 Witherbloom, the Balancer** — Legendary 5/5 Elder Dragon {6}{B}{G}; Affinity for creatures; Flying deathtouch; instant/sorcery spells you cast have affinity for creatures. (complex)\n     - **SOS 257 Great Hall of the Biblioplex** — Land; {T}: Add {C}; {T}, Pay 1 life: add any color (instants/sorceries only); {5}: becomes 2/4 Wizard with \"Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn\", still a land. (complex)\n\n   - **All 10 SOS card_impl.py templates** are currently identical stubs:\n     ```python\n     \"\"\"Card implementation for <Name>.\"\"\"\n     from __future__ import annotations\n     from engine.card import CardImpl\n     from typing import TYPE_CHECKING\n     if TYPE_CHECKING:\n         from engine.game_state import GameState\n     class <ClassName>(CardImpl):\n         \"\"\"TODO: Implement <Name>.\"\"\"\n         pass\n     ```\n     Class names: TheDawningArchaic, TogetherAsOne, EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares, ManaSculpt, RalZarekGuestLecturer, ImprovisationCapstone, LoreholdTheHistorian, SilverquillTheDisputant, WitherbloomTheBalancer, GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex.\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - No implementation errors yet — still in research/exploration phase. One Bash `Read` of FDN cards produced output too large (30.5KB) and was saved to a tool-results file, which I then read fully.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Identified that `AttacksTriggeredEvent` and `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` exist in events.py but are NOT fired by combat.py / casting.py respectively — engine changes needed.\n   - Identified no \"beginning of main phase\" trigger event exists (needed for Mana Sculpt delayed mana and Paradigm).\n   - Identified ManaPool lacks \"total mana spent\" tracking (needed for Mana Sculpt amount of {C}).\n   - Identified skip-turns not handled in turn.py / game_state.py (needed for Ral Zarek -7).\n   - Identified fdn_133 (the natural land-becomes-creature reference) is an unimplemented stub, so SOS 257 needs original engine work.\n   - Identified `copy_spell` exists for spell copies (casualty SOS 226).\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - (Initial, with system-reminders about deferred tools and skills) \"Implement the following SOS cards: 1, 