 = getattr(card, \"chosen_targets\", None)\n         if chosen: return chosen[0]\n         return getattr(card, \"_resolve_target\", None)\n     def _counter_spell(game, stack_obj):\n         from engine.stack import StackObject\n         if not isinstance(stack_obj, StackObject): return\n         card = stack_obj.source\n         stack_items = game.stack._items\n         found = False\n         for i, item in enumerate(stack_items):\n             if item is stack_obj: stack_items.pop(i); found = True; break\n         if not found: return\n         controller = stack_obj.controller; owner = getattr(card, \"owner\", controller)\n         if controller is not None:\n             sz = controller.zones[Zone.STACK]\n             if sz.contains(card): sz.remove(card)\n         if owner is not None: owner.zones[Zone.GRAVEYARD].add(card)\n     ```\n     `can_cast` returns True only if a non-self spell is on stack; `get_targets` returns `[TargetRequirement(filter_fn=lambda obj: obj is not self and getattr(obj,\"is_spell\",True), description=\"target spell\", zone=Zone.STACK)]`.\n   - `/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_205/card_impl.py` + tests.py (Wardens, converge) — ETB token creation in `on_resolve`; `self.colors_spent` initialized to int 0; tests set `card.colors_spent = 2` (int) and call `card.on_resolve(game)` directly. NOTE conflict: cast_spell sets colors_spent to a LIST — so converge cards must handle both (use `len(cs) if isinstance(cs,(list,set,tuple)) else int(cs)`).\n   - `/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_134/card_impl.py` (Ajani planeswalker) — `get_loyalty_abilities()` returns `[LoyaltyAbility(loyalty_cost=+1, effect=_plus1, description=...), ...]`; effects read `getattr(pw, \"_resolve_target\", None)`; counters set `target._base_plus_one_counters` too; tokens via `create_token`.\n   - `/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_6/card_impl.py` (Claws Out, affinity) — `cost_reduction` counts permanents with subtype \"Cat\"; +2/+2 via `ContinuousEffect(source=self, layer=Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS, sublayer=SubLayer.MODIFY_PT, apply=_apply_buff, duration=DURATION_END_OF_TURN)`.\n   - `/workspace/cards/fdn/fdn_*/` basic_lands.py pattern: `ManaAbility(cost=_tap_cost, mana_produced=_effect, description=\"{T}: Add {W}.\")` where `_effect` adds to `source.controller.mana_pool`.\n   - **All 10 SOS card_impl.py are still identical stubs** (class names: TheDawningArchaic, TogetherAsOne, EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares, ManaSculpt, RalZarekGuestLecturer, ImprovisationCapstone, LoreholdTheHistorian, SilverquillTheDisputant, WitherbloomTheBalancer, GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex).\n   - **SOS specs summary:** SOS 1 Dawning Archaic ({10} 7/7 Avatar Legendary, {1} less per inst/sorc in GY, Reach, attacks→free-cast target inst/sorc from GY, if it would go to GY exile instead). SOS 4 Together as One ({6} Sorcery, Converge: target player draws X, deal X to any target, gain X life). SOS 13 Emeritus//Swords ({1}{W}{W} 3/3 Cat Cleric // {W} Instant; ETB target player creates 1/1 W/B Inkling flier, then if opp controls more creatures→prepared; Prepared). SOS 57 Mana Sculpt ({1}{U}{U} Instant; counter target spell; if you control Wizard, add {C} = mana spent on it at beginning of your next main phase). SOS 97 Ral Zarek ({1}{B}{B} Planeswalker loyalty 3; +1 Surveil 2; -1 any number target players each discard; -2 return creature MV≤3 from GY to bf; -7 flip 5 coins, target opp skips next X turns = heads). SOS 120 Improvisation Capstone ({5}{R}{R} Sorcery Lesson; exile from top until total MV≥4, may cast any free; Paradigm). SOS 201 Lorehold ({3}{R}{W} 5/5 Elder Dragon; flying haste; each inst/sorc in hand has miracle {2}; at each opp upkeep may discard then draw). SOS 226 Silverquill ({2}{W}{B} 4/4 Elder Dragon; flying vigilance; your inst/sorc spells have casualty 1). SOS 245 Witherbloom ({6}{B}{G} 5/5 Elder Dragon; affinity for creatures; flying deathtouch; your inst/sorc spells have affinity for creatures). SOS 257 Great Hall ({T}:{C}; {T}+pay1life: any color for inst/sorc only; {5}: becomes 2/4 Wizard with \"whenever you cast inst/sorc, +1/+0 EOT\", still a land).\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - `python` not found → use `python3`. (pytest baseline run succeeded with python3: 1184 passed.)\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Confirmed AttacksTriggeredEvent and SpellCastTriggeredEvent are defined but NEVER fired; no main-phase event exists; ManaPool lacks total-spent; no skip-turns. All planned additions are additive and safe (no base triggers watch them, so firing is a no-op for existing tests).\n   - Confirmed baseline 1184 passing before changes.\n   - Designed skip-turns logic for advance_phase (2-player): add `self.skip_turns` (list/dict per seat); in normal-rotation branch, if `skip_turns[next_idx] > 0`, decrement and give turn to `1 - next_idx` WITHOUT flipping `_normal_next_index` (so skipped player goes next). Traced: with skip[1]=1, sequence A,A,B,A,B... correct; X=2 gives A,A,A,B... correct.\n   - Designed Mana Sculpt delayed mana via a one-shot TriggerRegistration on BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent with condition `not fired and game.active_player is controller`, effect adds {C} and unregisters self (source=self persists in graveyard since instants don't unregister).\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - (Initial, this session) System-reminders only: contents of PROJECT_MAP.md, AGENTS.md, engine/protection.py, and notice of large tool-results/test_utils files; plus deferred-tools list. Then the continuation summary block.\n   - \"Tool loaded.\" (after ToolSearch loaded task tools)\n   - (Final) \"CRITICAL: Respond with TEXT ONLY. Do NOT call any tools... Your task is to create a detailed summary of the conversation so far...\"\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Complete remaining additive engine changes: (a) fire AttacksTriggeredEvent in combat.py declare_attackers_step; (b) fire SpellCastTriggeredEvent in casting.py cast_spell + cast_spell_free, set `card.mana_spent`, add external cost reduction to get_cost_reduction; (c) add `last_payment_total` to mana.py ManaPool.pay; (d) add skip_turns to game_state.py advance_phase.\n   - Implement all 10 SOS cards (tasks #2–#11).\n   - Write per-card tests at `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py` (task #12) and run full pytest confirming no regressions (without touching engine_tests or FDN tests).\n\n8. Current Work:\n   I had just completed research (task #1 marked complete) and started the additive engine changes. I ran a baseline `python3 -m pytest -q` → **1184 passed, 25 warnings**. I then made:\n   - Edit #1 to `/workspace/engine/events.py`: added `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent` dataclass (fields `phase`, `player`) immediately after `BeginningOfCombatTriggeredEvent`.\n   - Edit #2 to `/workspace/engine/turn.py`: added a new elif branch in `run_turn` that fires `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(phase=game.phase, player=game.active_player)` when `game.phase in (PRECOMBAT_MAIN, POSTCOMBAT_MAIN) and game.step is None`, placed between the DRAW branch and the COMBAT branch.\n   These two edits support Mana Sculpt's delayed \"beginning of your next main phase\" mana and Improvisation Capstone's Paradigm.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Continue making the remaining additive engine changes in the same batch before implementing cards, directly in line with the planned shared infrastructure. Specifically, next: edit `/workspace/engine/combat.py` `declare_attackers_step` to fire `AttacksTriggeredEvent(creature=attacker, attacker=attacker)` for each declared attacker after the attacker loop (needed for SOS 1 The Dawning Archaic's attacks trigger), then edit `/workspace/engine/casting.py` to fire `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` (needed for SOS 226 Silverquill casualty and SOS 257 Great Hall pump), set `card.mana_spent` and add external cost reduction (for SOS 245 Witherbloom granting affinity), then `/workspace/engine/mana.py` `last_payment_total` (for SOS 57 Mana Sculpt amount), then `/workspace/engine/game_state.py` skip_turns (for SOS 97 Ral Zarek -7). After each logical group, re-run `pytho