redEvent trigger (event.player is ctrl, phase PRECOMBAT_MAIN) → choose_yes_no to _do_capstone again.\n     - **Ral Zarek (Planeswalker starting_loyalty=3, Ral, Legendary)**: get_loyalty_abilities = [+1 Surveil 2 (per-card choose_yes_no graveyard), -1 players discard, -2 return creature MV≤3 from GY via _resolve_target/choose, -7 flip 5 coins (allow forced via getattr(self,\"_forced_heads\",None)) X=heads → game.skip_turns[opp_index] += X].\n\n8. Current Work:\n   Immediately before this summary I was completing the additive engine infrastructure changes (task #13, now marked complete) and preparing to implement the cards. The most recent concrete action was editing `/workspace/engine/casting.py` `_resolve_spell` to honor the `_exile_instead_of_graveyard` flag (needed by The Dawning Archaic and Improvisation Capstone's Paradigm):\n   ```python\n   if card.card_types & _PERMANENT_TYPES:\n       move_to_zone(game, card, Zone.STACK, Zone.BATTLEFIELD)\n   elif getattr(card, \"_exile_instead_of_graveyard\", False):\n       card._exile_instead_of_graveyard = False\n       move_to_zone(game, card, Zone.STACK, Zone.EXILE)\n   else:\n       move_to_zone(game, card, Zone.STACK, Zone.GRAVEYARD)\n   ```\n   All five planned additive engine changes are now done (AttacksTriggeredEvent firing, SpellCastTriggeredEvent firing + card.mana_spent + external cost reduction, mana last_payment_total, skip_turns, _exile_instead_of_graveyard flag). The 1184-test baseline passed after the first four; the _exile flag edit has NOT yet been re-verified with pytest (it is gated behind a getattr default False, so expected safe). No SOS card has been implemented yet — all 10 remain stubs.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Re-run `python3 -m pytest -q` to confirm the `_exile_instead_of_graveyard` edit kept the 1184 baseline, then begin implementing SOS 57 Mana Sculpt (task #2) per the design above, marking task #2 in_progress. This is directly in line with the user's request: \"Implement the following S