et_mana_abilities=[{T}:{C}, {T}+pay1life: any color (controller chooses) for inst/sorc only]; get_activated_abilities=[{5}: animate if not creature → 2/4 Wizard]; animation via permanent ContinuousEffect at Layer.TYPE adding CREATURE+Wizard, SETting modified_power=2/toughness=4, plus SpellCastTriggeredEvent +1/+0 EOT pump; define power/toughness properties guarded with getattr defaults (0 pre-animation); only set base_power when animated.\n     - **Lorehold (Creature {3}{R}{W} 5/5 Elder Dragon LEGENDARY FLYING|HASTE)**: register_triggers (a) DrawsCardTriggeredEvent miracle (controller, inst/sorc, cards_drawn_this_turn==1) → stash, choose_yes_no, pay ManaCost(generic=2), cast_spell_free from HAND; (b) BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent where game.active_player is NOT controller → choose_yes_no discard then draw.\n     - **Emeritus//Swords (Creature {1}{W}{W} 3/3 Cat Cleric LEGENDARY)**: on_resolve (self-ETB) target player creates 1/1 W/B Inkling flier; if opp creatures > controller creatures(+1) set _prepared; get_activated_abilities returns prepared STP (choose target creature, exile, its controller gains life=power, reset _prepared).\n     - **Improvisation Capstone (Sorcery {5}{R}{R} Lesson)**: `_do_capstone` exiles top until total cmc>=4, choose_yes_no per castable → cast_spell_free from EXILE; on_resolve runs it + set _exile_instead_of_graveyard + register recurring BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent (event.player is ctrl, PRECOMBAT_MAIN) → choose_yes_no to repeat.\n     - **Ral Zarek (Planeswalker {1}{B}{B} starting_loyalty=3, Ral, LEGENDARY)**: get_loyalty_abilities=[+1 Surveil 2; -1 players discard; -2 return creature MV<=3 from GY (via _resolve_target/choose); -7 flip 5 coins (allow `getattr(self,\"_forced_heads\",None)`) X=heads → `game.skip_turns[opp_index] += X`].\n\n8. Current Work:\n   I was implementing SOS 1 The Dawning Archaic (task #6, marked in_progress). I read `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_1/card_spec.json`: name \"The Dawning Archaic\", mana_cost \"{10