costs — such as Etali, Primal Storm\n296-    or cascade.\n297-\n298-    Pipeline\n299-    --------\n300-    1. **can_cast** — ask the card whether it can legally be cast (same\n301-       legality as :func:`cast_spell`, minus mana/timing constraints).\n302-    2. Move *card* from *from_zone* to the stack zone.\n303-    3. Choose targets (if applicable) with validation and protection check.\n304-    4. Call ``on_cast`` hook.\n305-    5. Push a :class:`StackObject` whose ``on_resolve`` callback handles\n306-       resolution normally (permanents → battlefield, non-permanents →\n307-       graveyard).\n308-\n309-    No timing check or mana payment is performed.  The spell goes on the\n310-    stack and can be responded to normally (e.g. countered).\n311-\n312-    If targeting or other post-move checks fail, the card is rolled back\n313-    to its source zone.\n314-\n315-    Parameters:\n316-        game: The current game state.","numLines":31}}
